{"ts": 1791258514.253962, "type": "step", "step": 11, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re probably talking about the evaluation section for the Week 3 build. The key distinction is:\n\n- **pass@k** = at least one of k runs succeeds\n- **pass^k** = all k runs succeed\n\nIf the build asks for **pass^k**, it wants reliability, not just a lucky success. A good writeup usually says:\n1. what the environment is (state, observations, actions),\n2. how you ran evaluation (how many seeds / trials),\n3. the **pass^k** result,\n4. any failure cases or limitations.\n\nIf you want, paste your eval paragraph here and I\u2019ll help you tighten it up without rewriting the whole thing for you.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: nice, I think I see it now\n[activity] t=0 messages 2m", "t": 2, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2930966219605771, "pomdp": 0.2930966219605771, "pass_k": 0.3575089192721116}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6914904699846633, "motivation": 0.7582565640937223, "reliance": 0.4841130265401042, "persistence": 0.3650501251360847, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.25123269521051517, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.32885785171436704, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
