{"ts": 1791258519.995688, "type": "step", "step": 18, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t just hand you the whole answer, but I can get you unstuck fast.\n\nFor the eval writeup, use this structure:\n- **Environment definition:** state, observations, actions\n- **Evaluation method:** what task/success criterion you used\n- **Reliability metric:** report **pass^k** = success on all k runs/seeds\n- **Result:** say whether it passed all runs or not\n\nA fill-in template:\n\u201cOn our [environment], we evaluated the agent over [k] independent runs/seeds. We measured success using [your criterion]. The agent achieved pass^k of [result], meaning it succeeded on all [k]/not all [k] runs.\u201d\n\nIf you paste your draft, I\u2019ll help you turn it into a correct final paragraph.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: makes sense. what next?\n[activity] t=10 messages 2m", "t": 12, "activity": [{"t": 10, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2930966219605771, "pomdp": 0.2930966219605771, "pass_k": 0.44111708585249004}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6714904699846633, "motivation": 0.7582565640937223, "reliance": 0.5241130265401042, "persistence": 0.3650501251360847, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.25123269521051517, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.32885785171436704, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258521.22665, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Next, let\u2019s do the most important part: draft the eval sentence together.\n\nUse this formula:\n1. Name the environment.\n2. Say how many runs/seeds you tested.\n3. State the success criterion.\n4. Report pass^k.\n\nTry filling this in:\n\u201cWe evaluated the agent in [environment] over [k] independent runs/seeds. Success was defined as [criterion]. The system achieved pass^k of [result], meaning it [did/did not] succeed on all runs.\u201d\n\nReply with your filled-in version, even if it\u2019s rough, and I\u2019ll help polish it.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: nice, I think I see it now\n[activity] t=12 messages 2m", "t": 14, "activity": [{"t": 12, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2930966219605771, "pomdp": 0.2930966219605771, "pass_k": 0.4763409632767587}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6714904699846633, "motivation": 0.7582565640937223, "reliance": 0.5441130265401042, "persistence": 0.3650501251360847, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.25123269521051517, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.32885785171436704, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
