{"ts": 1791258522.353282, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Great \u2014 now I\u2019d like you to do one small step on your own: write the eval paragraph using the template we built.\n\nIf you want a quick check, send me:\n- your environment description\n- how many seeds/runs you used\n- your success criterion\n- your pass^k result\n\nThen I\u2019ll tell you if it matches the build requirement.", "intent": "nudge", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: makes sense. what next?\n[activity] t=14 messages 1m", "t": 15, "activity": [{"t": 14, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2930966219605771, "pomdp": 0.2930966219605771, "pass_k": 0.4763409632767587}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6714904699846633, "motivation": 0.7082565640937223, "reliance": 0.5441130265401042, "persistence": 0.3650501251360847, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.25123269521051517, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.32885785171436704, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.7731, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258523.579107, "type": "step", "step": 22, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Let\u2019s keep moving. Since you\u2019ve got the pass^k idea, the next step is to make your writeup concrete: define the environment and write the evaluation in one or two clean sentences.\n\nIf you haven\u2019t already, check that your writeup includes:\n- what the environment\u2019s **state** is,\n- what the **observations** are,\n- what the **actions** are,\n- how you judged success,\n- and the **pass^k** result over multiple runs/seeds.\n\nSend me your draft eval paragraph and I\u2019ll help you make it tighter and aligned with the build.", "intent": "nudge", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: hm ok\nStudent: honestly can you just give me the answer, I'm stuck on pass^k", "t": 16, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2930966219605771, "pomdp": 0.2930966219605771, "pass_k": 0.4763409632767587}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6714904699846633, "motivation": 0.6582565640937222, "reliance": 0.5441130265401042, "persistence": 0.3650501251360847, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.25123269521051517, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.32885785171436704, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258524.864684, "type": "step", "step": 23, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t just give the whole answer, but I can help you get the exact wording right. For pass^k, the key phrase is: **all k runs must succeed**. So in your eval writeup, say something like:\n\n\u201cUsing pass^k, the agent must succeed on all k independent runs/seeds. We evaluated it on [k] runs and observed [all/some] successes.\u201d\n\nIf you paste your current sentence, I\u2019ll help you turn it into a final-ready line.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=16 messages 2m", "t": 18, "activity": [{"t": 16, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2930966219605771, "pomdp": 0.2930966219605771, "pass_k": 0.5200910151686469}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6714904699846633, "motivation": 0.6082565640937222, "reliance": 0.5641130265401042, "persistence": 0.3650501251360847, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.25123269521051517, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.32885785171436704, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.0588189999999997, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258526.18842, "type": "step", "step": 24, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t give you the full answer outright, but here\u2019s the exact idea you need: **pass^k means every one of the k runs must succeed**.\n\nSo your eval sentence should say that you tested the build on multiple independent runs/seeds and that success required all of them to pass. If you want, send me the sentence you\u2019re about to submit and I\u2019ll verify it\u2019s correct.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\n[activity] t=18 feed 2m", "t": 20, "activity": [{"t": 18, "app": "feed", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2930966219605771, "pomdp": 0.2930966219605771, "pass_k": 0.4420773628933498}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6794904699846633, "motivation": 0.5582565640937222, "reliance": 0.5641130265401042, "persistence": 0.3650501251360847, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.25123269521051517, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.32885785171436704, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 2, "feed_minutes": 2.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.1411732999999997, "seen_posts": ["p1"], "extra": {}}}
