{"ts": 1791258528.9347992, "type": "step", "step": 28, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "That peer tip is pointing you in the right direction: the eval writeup is short because it\u2019s mostly about one thing \u2014 **pass^k**.\n\nSo don\u2019t overcomplicate it. Your eval section should basically answer:\n- What was the environment?\n- How many runs/seeds did you use?\n- What counted as success?\n- Did it succeed on **all** k runs (pass^k) or not?\n\nIf you\u2019re ready, send me your current eval paragraph and I\u2019ll help make it submission-ready.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=23 feed 2m", "t": 25, "activity": [{"t": 23, "app": "feed", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2930966219605771, "pomdp": 0.2930966219605771, "pass_k": 0.5121615668129808}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6894904699846633, "motivation": 0.47825656409372214, "reliance": 0.5641130265401042, "persistence": 0.3650501251360847, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.25123269521051517, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.32885785171436704, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 7, "feed_minutes": 7.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.1988213099999996, "seen_posts": ["p1", "p4", "p3"], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258530.2744489, "type": "step", "step": 29, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t give the full answer outright, but I can give you the exact logic to use:\n\n- **pass^k** means **all k runs succeed**.\n- So your eval section should say you ran the agent on multiple independent seeds/runs.\n- Then state whether it succeeded on every run (pass^k) or failed on at least one.\n\nA submission-ready template is:\n\u201cEvaluating on [k] independent runs/seeds, the system achieved pass^k because it succeeded on all [k] runs.\u201d\n\nIf your actual result was not perfect, change the last clause to reflect that it did not pass on every run.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: sure\n[activity] t=25 messages 2m", "t": 27, "activity": [{"t": 25, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2930966219605771, "pomdp": 0.2930966219605771, "pass_k": 0.5542159395176129}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6894904699846633, "motivation": 0.42825656409372215, "reliance": 0.5841130265401042, "persistence": 0.3650501251360847, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.25123269521051517, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.32885785171436704, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 7.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.2391749169999997, "seen_posts": ["p1", "p4", "p3"], "extra": {}}}
